{"id":134236244017051,"name":" Climb and Slide!","desc":"🎉 Welcome to Climb & Slide!\n\nGet ready for an exciting challenge where you’ll climb towering structures and slide down at high speeds, all while avoiding tricky obstacles and collecting rewards along the way.\nStart your journey by scaling iconic locations like the Beach, City, and more — then unlock community-made towers that keep the fun going!\n\nClimb and slide your way to the top. 👑\n\nHow to Play:\n🧗 Climb through challenges\n💰 Collect coins\n🐦 Unlock rides\n🌍 Unlock maps\n\n🔓 New Code: Release\n👍 Join our group and like the game to get more updates!","path":"/game/134236244017051-climb-and-slide","slug":"134236244017051-climb-and-slide","thumbnail":["https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-fb609b1d9e7bcc17f5fd200dc1ea756e/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter","https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-e51d31acb26001c2a56a8d11931f5320/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter","/brand/kocakz-logo.png"],"playing":33,"visitor":87518446,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-12-12T11:26:06.627Z","creator":{"name":"Huge Clock","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":11,"freeCount":11,"keyCount":2,"verifiedCount":0},"page":1,"next":null,"total":1,"scripts":[{"slug":"Climb-and-Slide!-Climb-and-Slide-infinitemoney-74349","_id":"693bfbced77d82777ce05f48","title":"Climb and Slide infinitemoney","game":{"_id":"688d09a0f367218b871c7a0d","gameId":134236244017051,"name":" Climb and Slide!","imageUrl":"/images/sb/rbx-e51d31acb26001c2a56a8d11931f5320-0c09d8f919fa.png","placeId":134236244017051},"features":"infinitemoney","tags":[],"script":"getgenv().infinitemoney = true\nloadstring(game:HttpGet(\"https://gist.githubusercontent.com/XCX443/7100311bbbccd9ba047a3d188df4257b/raw/7568fe1994124fb2792a4305d8d6dd389780c0b0/Climb%2520and%2520Slide%2520%257C%2520infinite%2520money\"))()","owner":{"_id":"67fab7f4f2b897410493aab6","username":"Zemon07","verified":false,"profilePicture":"/images/photo/67fab7f4f2b897410493aab6-1790848179667.png","status":"offline","id":"67fab7f4f2b89741049